"inference": {"question": "Why might individuals choose to engage in herd behavior?", "correct": "They may be attempting to benefit from group success without personal risk.", "distractors": ["They have been trained to always trust the majority opinion.", "They are unable to process private information independently.", "They are forced to by market regulations."], "explanation": "The text mentions it acts as a mechanism 'allowing individuals to learn from the group's success without taking the same personal risks'."},
